00:50:07.980 --> 00:50:27.850
Rev. David Schwartz (he/him): Such a phylactery is like a millstone set to the water of souls useful, but only the barest beginning of the possible. Imagine, for example, a golem or automata powered by such mode of force. Imagine, for example, anything possible powered by a captive soul.

