890
01:24:52.080 --> 01:25:07.349
Rev. David Schwartz (he/him): When the tree lost a branch in the storm, she would bandage it. When another needed healing, she would heal it and help them grow strong again. And when they grew sad at the thought of one day being cut down, she would help them remember that all things which have a beginning have an ending.

891
01:25:08.950 --> 01:25:14.859
